  "notes": [
    "policy_on / policy_off: build the payload from the inputs, obfuscate it with obfuscation_nonce_hex (G2 layer, PLAN.md 3.35.8), and the GP1 wire must equal expect.wire byte for byte; parsing expect.wire must give back the inputs.",
    "kek_hex = crypto_pwhash(32, UTF-8(NFC(password)), salt, ops, mem, ALG_ARGON2ID13); verifier_hex = crypto_generichash(32, UTF-8(\"secutg/grouppw/verify/v1\") || 0x00 || UTF-8(group_id), key = KEK).",
    "unlock: derive the verifier of password under policy (group_id, salt, ops, mem) and compare to policy.verifier_hex in constant time; the result must equal expect_match.",
    "payload_parse_fail: the de-obfuscated payload text must be rejected by the strict parser. wire_parse_fail: the whole message must not parse as a GP1 (and must not be adopted)."
  ],
